The endpoint, default public client parameters, request structure and language
mapping are derived from the upstream main.js and info.json. Lumin replaces the
Pot/Tauri JavaScript entry point with a Go JSON-stdio executable, adds bounded
HTTP handling, cancellation, validation, optional settings and regression tests.
No upstream logo is included. This plugin is not an official Caiyun product.

The .luminext package includes corresponding build source under src/ (plugin,
JSON-stdio SDK, tests and a standalone go.mod). See README.md for rebuilding.
